---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Shutter Scotland | See Edinburgh Differently">
	<main>
	<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; width: 100%; border-bottom: 3px solid #0A0A0A; overflow: hidden; background-color: #FAFAFA;">
		
		<div style="flex: 0 0 auto; width: 41.66%; min-width: 320px; padding: 48px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; border-right: 3px solid #0A0A0A; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: #FAFAFA;">
			
			<div style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
				<span style="font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; background-color: #0A0A0A; color: #FAFAFA; padding: 2px 8px; tracking: 0.1em;">MANIFESTO_01</span>
				<h1 style="font-family: 'Arial Black', 'Impact', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 4.5rem); text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.05em; color: #0A0A0A; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 0;">
					SEE EDINBURGH <br><span style="color: #FF4500;">DIFFERENTLY.</span>
				</h1>
			</div>
			
			<div style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
				<p style="font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; color: #3F3F46; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 440px; border-left: 3px solid #FF4500; padding-left: 16px; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
					Most city tours are just history lectures in disguise. Most photography sites just want to sell you a print. Shutter Scotland is the bridge between the two. 
				</p>
				<p style="font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; color: #0A0A0A; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 440px; margin: 0;">
					We trade the crowded viewpoints for raw urban geometry and brutalist horizons. Whether you're shooting on a flagship DSLR or a smartphone, I’ll show you how to strip away the "postcard" noise and capture the city’s actual pulse.
				</p>
			</div>
			
			<div style="padding-bottom: 12px;">
	<a href="/portfolio" class="brutalist-cta-btn" style="display: inline-block; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; border: 3px solid #0A0A0A; background-color: #FF4500; color: #FAFAFA; padding: 14px 28px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px 0px #0A0A0A;">
		[LOCK IN A ROUTE]
	</a>
</div>
		</div>
		
		<div style="flex: 1 1 0%; min-width: 320px; min-height: 550px; background-color: #0A0A0A; relative; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box;">
			<img 
				src="/images/royal-mile-street-image.jpg" 
				alt="Black and white street photography of Edinburgh Royal Mile through a stone archway" 
				style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; filter: contrast(1.15);"
			/>
			<div style="position: absolute; bottom: 16px; right: 16px; background-color: #0A0A0A; border: 1px solid #FAFAFA; color: #FAFAFA; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 4px 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; opacity: 0.8; z-index: 20;">
				LOC_EDINBURGH_ROYAL_MILE
			</div>
		</div>

	</section>

		<section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 font-mono-clean text-sm border-b border-punk-black">
			<div class="p-6 md:p-8 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-punk-black space-y-3 hover:bg-punk-accent hover:text-punk-white transition-all duration-300 group">
				<h3 class="font-sans-heavy text-lg uppercase tracking-tight text-punk-black group-hover:text-punk-white">01 // COMMAND YOUR CAMERA</h3>
				<p class="text-punk-grey group-hover:text-punk-white/90">Ditch the auto mode framework. Take complete mathematical and creative control over exposure, depth, and structural dynamics.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="p-6 md:p-8 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-punk-black space-y-3 hover:bg-punk-accent hover:text-punk-white transition-all duration-300 group">
				<h3 class="font-sans-heavy text-lg uppercase tracking-tight text-punk-black group-hover:text-punk-white">02 // HUNT THE SHADOWS</h3>
				<p class="text-punk-grey group-hover:text-punk-white/90">Learn to read urban geometry. We bypass the crowded lookout spots to target raw textures, brutal horizons, and slick contrasts.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="p-6 md:p-8 space-y-3 hover:bg-punk-accent hover:text-punk-white transition-all duration-300 group">
				<h3 class="font-sans-heavy text-lg uppercase tracking-tight text-punk-black group-hover:text-punk-white">03 // OWN THE ARTWORK</h3>
				<p class="text-punk-grey group-hover:text-punk-white/90">Stop filling your phone storage with digital noise. Finish the walk with custom-framed, gallery-grade captures that look distinctively yours.</p>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</MainLayout>
<style>
	/* Targeting our custom inline-styled CTA button */
	.brutalist-cta-btn {
		transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out !important;
	}

	.brutalist-cta-btn:hover {
		background-color: #0A0A0A !important;
		color: #FF4500 !important;
		border-color: #FF4500 !important;
		box-shadow: 0px 0px 0px 0px #0A0A0A !important;
		transform: translate(4px, 4px) !important;
	}
	
	.brutalist-cta-btn:active {
		transform: scale(0.98) !important;
	}
</style>